'''Santa Claws at Work!''' (働くニャンタクロース！, ''Hataraku Nyanta Kurōsu！'', '''Working Nyanta Claus!''') is the Christmas event in [[The Battle Cats]]. It was added in [[Version 11.10 Update|Version 11.10]]. '''Night 3: Christmas Eve Redelivery''' was added in [[Version 13.0 Update|Version 13.0]].

==Event Information==
Xmas is back in the Empire of Cats! Let's celebrate the holidays with seasonal Ubers and special stages!<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''On from December 15th (11:00am) until December 29th (10:59am)!'''}}

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''・ Limited Xmas Gals Capsules'''}}<br>
Catsmas cuties are available for a limited time!<br>
Talents unlocked {{Color|#34A853|'''for Uber Rare Keiji Claus'''}}!<br>
Tap the banner in the Rare Capsules to check the available lineup of characters and their abilities!

※ Each of the above characters will be available only during this event.<br>
※ Tap the banner in the Rare Capsules for more info.

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''●Return of Limited Edition Xmas Stages!'''}}<br>
A Reindeer rebellion?!?! Holiday challengers are here to test your skill!<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''Clear rewards reset'''}} for all past stages!<br>
Visit Stories of Legend/Event Stages to take on these special seasonal maps!

{{Color|#EA4335|'''・Night 1: Santa Claws at Work'''}}<br>
Clear this stage for a small chance to earn {{Color|#34A853|'''A Gift of Cats'''}}!<br>
Reward(s): Rare Cat "A Gift of Cats", Rare Ticket, etc.

※ Use a Treasure Radar for a 100% chance of unlocking this character.<br>
※ This character cannot be unlocked again if earned from a previous event.<br>
※ After unlocking this character, activate it by visiting the Rare Cats section of the Upgrade menu.<br>
※ Players who have previously collected "A Gift of Cats" cannot collect this stage reward.

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''・Night 2: Christmas Eve Delivery (Gauntlet)'''}}<br>
Many presents await children with patience!<br>
Reward(s): Rare Ticket, Cat Ticket, Catamin (A, B, C), etc.

※ After clearing a stage from this map, there will be a brief cooldown period before the next gauntlet stage can be accessed.<br>
※ You may choose to spend a Catamin A to skip the cooldown and challenge the next Gauntlet stage immediately.<br>
※ This stage will appear after clearing Empire of Cats Ch. 1.

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''・From Week Two, "Night 3: Christmas Eve Redelivery"'''}}<br>
Couldn't catch the family while they were home? Try one more time to make the delivery! Plus, {{Color|#9900FF|'''new stages'''}} have been added!<br>
Reward(s): Rare Ticket, Behemoth Stone (Purple, Red, Blue, Green, Yellow)<br>
On from December 22nd (11:00am) until December 29th (10:59am)!

※ Tap the Timed Score button on the "Christmas Eve Redelivery" map screen to view all possible score rewards.<br>
※ This stage will appear after clearing Empire of Cats Ch. 1.<br>
※ You must clear Empire of Cats Ch. 3 in order to play "Christmas Eve Redelivery."

